# Eclipsed Steppe: "This land enters tapped unless you control two or more basic lands." Bot1 controls two Scrublands - two
# lands with the Plains and Swamp types, but neither basic (CR 205.4c; two or more of these lands do not count) - and no
# basic land at all, so its Eclipsed Steppe enters tapped. Bot2 with a Plains and a Swamp plays the same land untapped
# (positive control).

[Bot1 Deck]
Scrubland
Scrubland
Eclipsed Steppe
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Swamp
Eclipsed Steppe
Swamp x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Scrubland.Play
Bot2.Hand.Plains.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Scrubland.Play
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Swamp.Play
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Eclipsed Steppe.Play
[T6 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Eclipsed Steppe.Play

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Eclipsed Steppe.Tapped = true
Bot2.Battlefield.Eclipsed Steppe.Tapped = false
